# Keep LF in the working tree, not just in the repository.
#
# The notebooks are build output: tools/make_notebook.py writes them through nbformat,
# which emits LF. If Git checked them out with CRLF, the next regeneration would rewrite
# every line and the diff would show the whole file as changed, hiding the cells that
# actually moved. The same applies to any generated text.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Notebooks are JSON: diff them as text, but do not let a merge tool try to resolve
# them line by line. Regenerate instead (that is what the CI currency check enforces).
*.ipynb text eol=lf merge=binary

# Figures saved next to a report: SVG is text, PNG is not.
*.svg text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
